@startuml EMREX_iGov_Compliant_Flow_ServerSide
autonumber "<b>[000]"

title **EMREX Flow - OpenID iGov Compliant (Server-Side Auth Request, No External Browser)**

skinparam monochrome false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

participant "EMC Frontend" as emc_fe
participant "EMC Backend" as emc_bff
participant "EMP Frontend" as emp_fe
participant "EMP Backend" as emp_bff
participant "EMP Resource Server" as emp_rs
participant "EMREG" as emreg

== 1. Institution Selection ==
emc_fe -> emc_bff: Get available EMPs
emc_bff -> emreg: GET /emp-list
emreg --> emc_bff: EMP data (iGov 4.1.1)
emc_bff --> emc_fe: EMP data
emc_fe -> emc_fe: Show EMP selection UI

== 2. Authorization Request Preparation ==
emc_fe -> emc_bff: Prepare auth request for selected EMP

group **PKCE + JWT Preparation (iGov 5.2)**
  emc_bff -> emc_bff: code_verifier = BASE64URL(SHA256(random(32)))\ncode_challenge = BASE64URL(SHA256(code_verifier))
  emc_bff -> emc_bff: Generate JWT with:\n- Header: alg=RS256, typ=JWT, kid=EMC_KEY_ID\n- Payload: iss=EMC_CLIENT_ID, sub=EMC_CLIENT_ID, aud=EMP_TOKEN_URL,\n jti=UUID(), iat=current_timestamp, exp=iat+300, nbf=iat, azp=EMC_CLIENT_ID (iGov 5.6.2)
  emc_bff -> emc_bff: Store code_verifier + state in session\n(linked to EMC session)
end group

emc_bff --> emc_fe: Authorization URL parameters
emc_fe -> emp_bff: HTTP 302 Redirect to EMP with:\nresponse_type=code\nclient_id=EMC_CLIENT_ID\nredirect_uri=https://emc.university.nl/callback\nscope=openid elmo\nstate=CSRF_TOKEN\nnonce=NONCE_VALUE\ncode_challenge=CODE_CHALLENGE\ncode_challenge_method=S256\nclient_assertion_type=urn:ietf:params:oauth:client-assertion-type:jwt-bearer\nclient_assertion=JWT

== 3. EMP Client Verification (iGov 5.6) and result selection ==
emp_bff -> emreg: GET /clients/EMC_CLIENT_ID\nAuthorization: Bearer EMP_API_TOKEN
emreg --> emp_bff: Client metadata with public key

group **JWT Validation (iGov 5.6.3)**
  emp_bff -> emp_bff: Verify signature with EMC public key
  emp_bff -> emp_bff: Validate claims:\n- iss == EMC_CLIENT_ID\n- aud == EMP_TOKEN_URL\n- exp > current time\n- nbf <= current time\n- azp == EMC_CLIENT_ID
end group

alt JWT valid
    emp_bff -> emp_fe: Redirect to EMP login
    emp_fe -> emp_bff: Get results
    emp_bff -> emp_bff: Get student results
    emp_bff --> emp_fe: Results for selection
    emp_fe -> emp_fe: Show results selection UI

    emp_fe -> emp_fe: User selects results + consent
    emp_fe -> emp_rs: Store user selection (ref_id=UUID(), selected_results=[...])
    emp_rs --> emp_fe: Confirm storage

    group **Authorization Code Generation (iGov 6.2)**
      emp_fe -> emp_bff: Generate auth code (code=AUTH_CODE_123)
      emp_bff -> emp_bff: Bind code to:\n- ref_id:UUID()\n- selected_results:[...]\n- client_id:EMC_CLIENT_ID\n- redirect_uri:https://emc.university.nl/callback
      emp_bff --> emp_fe: Auth code
    end group
    emp_fe -> emc_fe: HTTP 302 Redirect to EMC callback\n(https://emc.university.nl/callback?code=AUTH_CODE_123&state=CSRF_TOKEN)
else JWT invalid
    emp_fe --> emc_fe: HTTP 302 Redirect to EMC with:\nerror=invalid_client\nerror_description=JWT+verification+failed\nstate=ORIGINAL_STATE (iGov 5.7)
end

== 4. Callback Handling (EMC Server) ==
emc_fe -> emc_bff: Receive callback with auth code + state
emc_bff -> emc_bff: Validate state matches session
emc_bff -> emc_bff: Retrieve code_verifier from session

== 5. Token Exchange (iGov 7) ==
emc_bff -> emp_bff: POST /token with:\ngrant_type=authorization_code\ncode=AUTH_CODE_123\nredirect_uri=https://emc.university.nl/callback\ncode_verifier=CODE_VERIFIER\nclient_assertion_type=urn:ietf:params:oauth:client-assertion-type:jwt-bearer\nclient_assertion=NEW_JWT

emp_bff -> emreg: GET /clients/EMC_CLIENT_ID\nAuthorization: Bearer EMP_API_TOKEN
emreg --> emp_bff: Client metadata with public key

group **Token Validation (iGov 7.2)**
  emp_bff -> emp_bff: Verify JWT signature with EMC public key
  emp_bff -> emp_bff: Validate code_verifier against code_challenge
  emp_bff -> emp_bff: Generate tokens:\n- access_token: ACCESS_TOKEN_456\n- id_token: ID_TOKEN_789\n- expires_in: 60\n -user_full_name\n -user_birthday\n- token_type: Bearer
end group

emp_bff --> emc_bff: Access token + ID token (iGov 7.3)

== 6. Data Retrieval with Signed Responses ==
group **ELMO XML (iGov 8.1)**
  emc_bff -> emp_rs: GET /results?data_format=elmo\nAuthorization: BearerCCESS_TOKEN_456\nX-Request-ID: REQ_12345
  emp_rs -> emp_rs: Sign response with EMP private key
  emp_rs --> emc_bff: Signed ELMO XML\nX-Signature: EMP_SIGNATURE_ABC123\nX-Signature-Algorithm: RS256
end group

group **User Info [Optional] (iGov 9)**
  emc_bff -> emp_rs: GET /results?data_format=userinfo\nAuthorization: Bearer ACCESS_TOKEN_456
  emp_rs -> emp_rs: Sign response with EMP private key
  emp_rs --> emc_bff: PDF document\nX-Signature: EMP_SIGNATURE_DEF456\nX-Signature-Algorithm: RS256
end group


group **EIDAS Info [Optional] (iGov 9)**
  emc_bff -> emp_rs: GET /results?data_format=eidas\nAuthorization: Bearer ACCESS_TOKEN_456
  emp_rs -> emp_rs: Sign response with EMP private key
  emp_rs --> emc_bff: PDF document\nX-Signature: EMP_SIGNATURE_DEF456\nX-Signature-Algorithm: RS256
end group

group **PDF Document [Optional]**
  emc_bff -> emp_rs: GET /results?data_format=pdf\nAuthorization: Bearer ACCESS_TOKEN_456
  emp_rs -> emp_rs: Sign response with EMP private key
  emp_rs --> emc_bff: PDF document\nX-Signature: EMP_SIGNATURE_DEF456\nX-Signature-Algorithm: RS256
end group

group **ELM JSON [Optional]**
  emc_bff -> emp_rs: GET /results?data_format=elm\nAuthorization: Bearer ACCESS_TOKEN_456
  emp_rs -> emp_rs: Sign response with EMP private key
  emp_rs --> emc_bff: ELM JSON\nX-Signature: EMP_SIGNATURE_GHI789\nX-Signature-Algorithm: RS256
end group

@enduml